  "title": "Greece and Israel Sign $3.5bn Missile and Air Defence Deal",
  "summary": "Greece and Israel have signed a $3.5bn missile and air defense deal to bolster their defense capabilities. The agreement aims to enhance their security in response to ongoing global tensions, including concerns over US-Israel war and Turkey's military capabilities.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "Greece and Israel have signed a $3.5bn missile and air defence deal to bolster their defense capabilities.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The agreement aims to enhance Greece's security in response to ongoing global tensions, including concerns over US-Israel war and Turkey's military capabilities.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Greece and Israel agreed to the deal by 2029, with the first layer of the multi-layered air defense network expected to be completed by that date.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
